      "initialText": "FIELD KILN\n\nSmall-batch objects for daily rituals\n\nYour bag ↗\nObjects/Tea service\n01 / FORM STUDY\nORIGINAL VECTOR ILLUSTRATION · SAMPLE PRODUCT\nA steady pour.\nRoom for a second cup.\n\nFIELD KILN · TEAWARE No. 04\n\nEveryday\nTeapot\n\nA generous little pot for slow mornings and one more cup. Shaped in stoneware, glazed by hand, made to find its way into the everyday.\n\n$68\nUSD\n+ $8 shipping\n\nIron · 4 available\n\nChoose a glaze — Iron\nIron\nAsh\nSold out\nSand\nQty\n1\n2\n3\n4\nAdd to bag\n↗\n\nItem total $68 · shipping calculated at checkout\n\nDispatch in 2 business days\n30-day returns on unused pieces\n\nMADE FOR THE TABLE\n\nGood company,\nevery day.\nMATERIAL\nGlazed stoneware\nDIMENSIONS\n16 cm wide × 12 cm high\nCAPACITY\n650 ml\nCARE\nHand wash. Avoid sudden temperature changes. Not for stovetop use.\nDELIVERY\nDispatch in 2 business days; illustrative domestic transit 3–5 business days.\nRETURNS\nUnused pieces accepted within 30 days. Customer pays return shipping; original shipping is nonrefundable.\nFIELD KILN · A FICTIONAL SAMPLE SHOP\nIllustrations and product details are illustrative.",
